 with some ",{"t":"a","c":["Memphis Design"],"id":"memphis-design"}," influences"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/b/b8/1_97a7890fabc0ab3772d7ff9a1d23ac7c.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241108165328","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["General Electric Catalog (1986)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/a/a9/PROSERPINE_1986_%28VHS_LOGO%29/revision/latest?cb=20240610152350","w":185,"h":185,"v":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:PROSERPINE_1986_(VHS_LOGO)","cap":["Proserpine video production (France, ca. 1986)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/9/91/Vgjunk_Joy_Joy_News_Sega_Master_System_cover_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172700","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["JoyJoy magazine special issue (1987)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/0/02/SEGA-Master-System-Information-Specs_%E2%80%94_Gametrog.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172700","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["SEGA Master System game boxes (1987 to mid-1990s)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/b/b6/Sega_Master_System_packaging_%281986%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172659","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["SEGA Master System packaging (1987)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/b/be/PXL2000.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172700","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["PXL2000 ad (ca. 1987)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/f/f0/Lego_Futuron_%281988%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172700","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["Lego Futuron set packaging (1988)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/f/fa/BASF_Chrome_Maxima_II%281%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172659","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["BASF ad, Germany (ca. 1989)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/1/10/Sanyo_PH-WCD950.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172700","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["Sanyo PH-WCD950 advertisement with Airbrush Surrealism elements (ca. 1989)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/8/82/Composition_with_Target_and_Ladder_%28Masoud_Yasami%2C_1993%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172657","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["Masoud Yasami, ",{"t":"i","c":["Composition with Target and Ladder"]}," (1993)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/b/b6/John_Marsden%2C_Out_of_Time_%28ca_1995%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526194943","w":185,"h":185,"cap":[{"t":"i","c":["Out of Time"]},", Pan Macmillan (ca. 1995?)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/6/64/Wobbledogsbreedingsim.png/revision/latest?cb=20241226074224","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["The breeding simulation in the game Wobbledogs (2021)"]}]},{"t":"h","l":3,"c":["Architecture and Interior Design"]},{"t":"gallery","items":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/a/a0/2000_Peel_-_Montreal.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172657","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["2000 Peel St, Montreal (Tolchinsky & Goodz, 1981)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/f/f6/Union_carbide.png/revision/latest?cb=20241108010504","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["Union Carbide Corporate Center (Kevin Roche, 1982)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/cc/Tumblr_n5suy9XVWK1rionq1o1_500.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250201172039","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["La Casa Telematica (Ugo La Pietra, 1983)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/4/43/Palette_Restaurant%2C_1984.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172659","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["Anthony Machado: Palette Restaurant Façade, Santa Monica (1984)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/4/43/Uoja-nho.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172700","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["St Louis Center Atrium, Saint Louis (1985)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/6/6b/Ikea_Catalog_%281983%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172658","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["1983 IKEA Catalogue"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/b/b9/Ikea%2C_1985%281%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172659","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["1985 IKEA Catalogue"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/8/83/Original_3d02d9e2d2140d74a72b8fccd078454d.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241108010456","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["Steelcase inc. offices, Grand Rapis, Michigan (date unknown, from ",{"t":"i","c":["Lighting the Workplace"]},", 1988)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/1/1e/Kullen_1.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241108010506","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["King Kullen, Bellmore, NY"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/c1/Kullen_2.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241108010505","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["From ",{"t":"i","c":["Market, Supermarket, and Hypermarket Design"]}," (1990)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/0/08/The_CItadel%2C_Austin.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172659","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e4/The_Citadel%2C_Austin_%282%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172700","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["The Citadel (Austin, TX, date unknown)"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/c7/Grid-spiration.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172659","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["Interior design, date unknown"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/f/f3/80s_glass_blocks.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172656","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["Interior design with chrome and glass blocks, date unknown"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/9/91/Glass_block_office.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172658","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["Postmodern design with glass blocks, date unknown"]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e0/Namco_booth_%282001%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240526172659","w":185,"h":185,"cap":["NAMCO booth, Tokyo Game Show (2001)"]}]},{"t":"h","l":3,"c":["Other Media"]},{"t":"gallery","items":[{"src":"https://static.